  title: "R\u1EEBng trong l\xF2ng hang"
  body: "Tr\u1EA7n hang S\u01A1n \u0110o\xF2ng c\xF3 nh\u1EEFng h\u1ED1 s\u1EE5t
    l\u1EDBn. \xC1nh s\xE1ng l\u1ECDt xu\u1ED1ng qua h\u1ED1 s\u1EE5t n\xEAn trong
    l\xF2ng hang c\xF3 c\u1EA3 nh\u1EEFng khu r\u1EEBng c\xE2y xanh."
  sourceRef: "VQG Phong Nha \u2013 K\u1EBB B\xE0ng (phongnhakebang.vn); UNESCO World
    Heritage List: Phong Nha-Ke Bang National Park."
